      <div type="commentary">
        <p n="1" ana="#tr.print">The framed manuscript page number [ⲓⲏ] stands at the left on this page and is printed with a bar above and below as the frame, not as a supralinear stroke.</p>
        <p n="7" ana="#tr.bracket">The bracket is not closed in the edition; it is closed here at the line end.</p>
        <p n="8" ana="#tr.bracket">The bracket is not closed in the edition; it is closed here at the line end.</p>
        <p n="9" ana="#tr.bracket">The edition opens a bracket at the end of the line; the lost letters and its closing bracket are in l. 10.</p>
        <p n="10" ana="#tr.bracket">The lost section at the start of the line is opened by a bracket at the end of l. 9; it is closed here after the dots.</p>
        <p n="12" ana="#tr.bracket">After ϩⲁⲗϭ the edition prints a closing bracket with no opening bracket on this line; the dots before it are encoded as illegible. At the line end the edition opens a bracket; its closing bracket is in l. 13.</p>
        <p n="13" ana="#tr.bracket">The lost section at the start of the line is opened by a bracket at the end of l. 12; it is closed here after the dots.</p>
        <p n="19" ana="#tr.bracket">The bracket before the last letters is not closed in the edition; it is closed here at the line end.</p>
        <p n="32" ana="#tr.bracket">At the line end the edition opens a bracket; it is not closed and is closed here at the line end.</p>
        <p n="33" ana="#tr.bracket">The bracket after ϫ is not closed in the edition; it is closed here at the line end.</p>
      </div>
